<title>USA: BPA offers no power for Tuesday schedulings.</title>
<headline>BPA offers no power for Tuesday schedulings.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bonneville Power Administration (BPA) did not offer any power for Tuesday schedulings, the agency said Monday.</p>
<p>BPA had offered 100 megawatts of peak firm power for Monday schedulings, but also had not offered surplus power for Saturday or Sunday deliveries.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau, +1 213 955 6761))</p>
